From: BPI-R4 build fix
Subject: [PATCH] bus: mhi: guard debugfs definitions with config

The mac80211 backports tree compiles drivers/bus/mhi/host/debugfs.c even
when CPTCFG_MHI_BUS_DEBUG is disabled. internal.h then provides static
inline stubs, causing duplicate definitions. Guard the implementation.

--- a/drivers/bus/mhi/host/debugfs.c
+++ b/drivers/bus/mhi/host/debugfs.c
@@ -3,7 +3,9 @@
  * Copyright (c) 2020, The Linux Foundation. All rights reserved.
  *
  */
 
+#if defined(CPTCFG_MHI_BUS_DEBUG) && CPTCFG_MHI_BUS_DEBUG
+
 #include <linux/debugfs.h>
 #include <linux/device.h>
 #include <linux/interrupt.h>
@@ -410,4 +412,6 @@ void mhi_debugfs_exit(void)
 {
 	debugfs_remove_recursive(mhi_debugfs_root);
 }
+
+#endif /* CPTCFG_MHI_BUS_DEBUG */
